      "## Research question and scope",
      "This protocol asks how the month-end close can be described from the operational record in outsourced billing operations. It is a measurement method, not a performance score or a legal conclusion. The Outsourced Billing Services reviewer records the claim file and denial appeal source and the next action in the same queue.",
      "The scope is one defined population and one observation window. State what is excluded before looking at results so the denominator cannot drift. For the Outsourced Billing Services desk, this claim file and denial appeal check is dated and routed to the billing manager before the next handoff.",
